  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Learn the fundamentals of blacksmithing in this hands-on workshop. You will forge a small take-home piece using traditional coal and propane forges, learn to draw out, taper, and bend hot steel, and practice basic tool-making skills. All materials and safety gear provided.</p>]]></content:encoded>
